{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Sun Cleric: Dawnsear spends one Dawn charge, with or without Solar Conduit (#12957)",
  "contract": [
    "#12957: Dawnsear spent 2 Dawn charges per cast. Dawn 807440 reads 'Your next 10 damaging or healing spells",
    "or abilities will trigger the Fulfillment effect of your Vow' and 'Each damaging or healing spell will",
    "expend a charge', so every spell spends exactly one. The Sun Cleric script spends that charge in",
    "OnSpellBeforeEffects. Dawn's effect 1 is aura 108 SPELLMOD_CASTING_TIME with class mask (0, 2, 0), matching",
    "Dawnsear's family flags, at 0% unless Solar Conduit 300321 raises it to -20% (#1562). Because Dawn uses",
    "charges, Player::ApplySpellMod registered Dawn in the spell's m_appliedMods whenever that modifier touched a",
    "cast-time Dawnsear, and Player::RemoveSpellMods then dropped a second charge. The fix removes Dawn from",
    "m_appliedMods when the script spends its charge, so the modifier still shapes the cast time. Rank 554406 is",
    "the level 60 Dawnsear from the report (3.5 s, SpellCastTimes 22). DISCRIMINATING: one Dawnsear takes Dawn",
    "from 10 to 9 charges (the bug gives 8), and a following Sunflare 800231 takes it to 8. With Solar Conduit",
    "the cast time is still 80% of the base and Dawnsear still spends one charge. Spell hit rating 10000 keeps",
    "the casts from missing; Dawn spends its charge either way."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "players": [
    { "id": "plain", "race": 1, "class": 27, "level": 80, "spell_hit_rating": 10000 },
    { "id": "conduit", "race": 1, "class": 27, "level": 80, "spell_hit_rating": 10000 }
  ],
  "creatures": [
    { "id": "dummy", "owner": "plain", "entry": 36, "distance": 5, "stationary": true }
